[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3626559858","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113632#issuecomment-3626559858","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113632","id":3626559858,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YKOly","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T11:59:35Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T11:59:35Z","body":"Checking these two boxes fixes the line numbers! This should be documented, or perhaps the build env can 'fix' this automatically?\r\n\r\n<img width=\"586\" height=\"159\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-12-08 at 12 51 00\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a792e6d-9af0-493d-bb5c-7d046f08f6f1\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3626559858/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3626609691","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113632#issuecomment-3626609691","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113632","id":3626609691,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YKawb","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T12:10:16Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T12:18:03Z","body":"> many functions show two zones in the profiler, an 'outer' and an 'inner'. Ideally these would be one zone, but this isn't a blocker for this PR in my opinion.\r\n\r\nThis is (unfortunately) expected. \r\n\r\nThe outer zone is the \"caller\" GDScript function. It is required to have this zone because it can show you the line number in the calling function (as long as `debug/settings/gdscript/always_track_call_stacks` is set to `true`). At this point, it's also not clear yet whether a GDScript function is called (which will lead to \"duplicated\" zones), or a system call (which won't).\r\n\r\nThe inner zone is the \"callee\", i.e. the called function. This zone is needed because it ensures calls from Godot to GDScript are profiled as expected. It also shows you the line number / file location of the called function. The difference between the two zones can be interpreted as the \"call overhead\".\r\n\r\nIt might be possible to make this just one zone, but this would probably be more complicated to implement.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3626609691/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3633923340","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113632#issuecomment-3633923340","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113632","id":3633923340,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YmUUM","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-09T19:27:31Z","updated_at":"2025-12-09T19:27:31Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3633923340/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]